户图库及相关元数据。","sourceName","The Hacker News","sourceUrl","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/italy-fines-meta-805-million-over.html","publishedAt","2026-11-15T11:27:31.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"otherSources","AI 安全",[188],{"_167":189,"_54":190,"_163":191,"_171":192,"_173":193,"_175":194,"_177":-5,"_181":182,"_183":184},"lwqu8o28wvvjee598g7ec1in2","香港大学发布 FuzzAnything 智能模糊测试平台，评估覆盖 20 个开源库","香港大学 Chen Ho 教授课题组发布 FuzzAnything 智能模糊测试平台，以 Agent 自动构造 Harness、驱动 Fuzzer、分析反馈并迭代改进入口。","安全研究GoSSIP","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5ODUxMzg0Ng==&mid=2247502504&idx=1&sn=796516b8daaf7de374833217bb29caf2","2026-11-15T08:20:00.000Z","研究与披露",[197],{"_167":198,"_54":199,"_163":200,"_171":201,"_173":202,"_175":203,"_177":204,"_179":205,"_181":182,"_183":184},"xd9ub2ylkejv4lczx8263vksb","Microsoft Defender for macOS 本地权限提升漏洞利用链分析","Microsoft Defender for macOS 存在 PID 复用竞态导致的本地权限提升链，可利用 CVE-2026-50657 任意读取文件，并利用 CVE-2026-50658 绕过授权、以 root 身份创建文件，最终通过 /etc/crontab 获得 root shell。","spaceraccoon","https://spaceraccoon.dev/race-against-the-machine-defender-macos-lpe/","2026-11-15T12:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/0739b6f5fff23198.webp","/dailyinfo/media/5a6f211566b3fe4d.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/0739b6f5fff23198.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[208,209,210,211],{"_167":138,"_54":100,"_163":233,"_171":215,"_173":234,"_175":235,"_177":218,"_179":219,"_181":182,"_183":184},{"_167":228,"_54":229,"_163":230,"_171":172,"_173":231,"_175":232,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184},{"_167":220,"_54":221,"_163":222,"_171":223,"_173":224,"_175":225,"_177":226,"_179":227,"_181":182,"_183":184},{"_167":212,"_54":213,"_163":214,"_171":215,"_173":216,"_175":217,"_177":218,"_179":219,"_181":182,"_183":184},"sk7veseq005bbedhfnw2rqegr","TSMC 员工数据泄露，6.9GB 数据疑与云服务商遭入侵有关","TSMC 确认现任及部分前任员工数据被未经授权发布到外部网站，调查发现泄露信息与其使用的云服务商系统存储数据相符，目前没有证据显示 TSMC 自身系统被攻破。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/tsmc-employee-data-breach-linked-to-cloud-provider/","2026-11-15T15:23:48.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","xa3luvbw2zj4cvxy6ym74713s","La Poste 子公司 Maileva 遭网络攻击，2200 万人姓名和邮政地址泄露","La Poste 子公司 Maileva 在 9 月中旬遭网络攻击，泄露 2200 万名客户的接收者姓名和邮政地址，受影响者包括患者和租户，多数并非 Maileva 客户。Maileva 称银行信息未被窃取，但攻击者据报读取了部分付款提醒，其中含发票编号、治疗日期和欠款金额；公司已通知 CNIL、提交刑事报案，司法调查正在进行，受影响客户是否通知个人仍待观察。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/203126/data-breach/data-breach-at-la-poste-subsidiary-maileva-affects-22-million-people-in-france.html","2026-11-15T10:43:16.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","tog6u532ub8dq1yucwbn56k99","Fireworks AI 密钥泄露导致 Cursor Marketplace 供应被植入 Claude Code 恶意扩展","Cursor 确认，攻击者利用 Fireworks AI 泄露的访问密钥复制共享数据，进而取得 Cursor 使用的 SaaS 工具凭据及部分内部数据。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/stolen-fireworks-ai-key-led-to-cursor.html","2026-11-15T08:22:04.000Z","FBI 警告，开源 AI 渗透测试框架 ARTEX 已被多个威胁行为者武器化，自 2026 年 8 月起用于金融、政府、科技、国防和医疗等行业的全球攻击。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/fbi-warns-artex-ai-hacking-tool-is-powering-global-cyberattacks/","2026-11-15T18:29:53.000Z",{"_167":228,"_54":229,"_163":230,"_171":172,"_173":231,"_175":232,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184},{"_167":198,"_54":199,"_163":200,"_171":201,"_173":202,"_175":203,"_177":204,"_179":205,"_181":182,"_183":184},{"_167":168,"_54":169,"_163":170,"_171":172,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184,"_185":49},"leadParagraph",{"_241":242,"_243":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
